	// A file whose function "target" spans lines 3..12 (10 lines); the focused
	// snippet only shows line 7. A huge function "big" spans 20..(20+searchFullBodyMaxLines+5).
	var b strings.Builder
	b.WriteString("package p\n\n")               // lines 1..2
